  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "006ab27",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Но мне не хватает 7 фотографий мостов и лодок на Сене!",
      "sourceEnText": "But I miss 7 photos about bridges and boats on the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_006ab27.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3788,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:33Z",
      "textHash": "70223fcb7e5dd1059df5c49d33ef85194adf2aa3369619b36f718208cc9595dd"
    },
    {
      "key": "00728bb",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_boat_guide",
      "sourceText": "Плавучий дом может стать вашим домом.",
      "sourceEnText": "A houseboat can be a home.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_00728bb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:55Z",
      "textHash": "fb8cfce5157ae0119fd6c4d6c78e598d3eb74d2f6549db30a5a74faa1dccb12b"
    },
    {
      "key": "0129c99",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "У этой лодки большие окна. Туристы могут любоваться городом. Это речной теплоход.",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat has large windows. Tourists can admire the city. It's a \"riverboat\".",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0129c99.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5355,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:33Z",
      "textHash": "2cf0f856f92fff52c24d767f50440094973319d9f7f8c67a6466ceb99a3444a2"
    },
    {
      "key": "0165157",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Почему эта лодка называется плавучим домом?",
      "sourceEnText": "Why is this boat called a houseboat?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0165157.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2769,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:26Z",
      "textHash": "cb466a7896f1b5deb6a4941257274ac46c8d3b8cd092886da3f7cf0d3369e860"
    },
    {
      "key": "01663fa",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_train",
      "sourceText": "Я бы с удовольствием прокатилась на поезде!",
      "sourceEnText": "I would love to ride a train!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_01663fa.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:05Z",
      "textHash": "335942bf36e9ba36626a3891180b2193d270751d5f3113676723df402ea1e8ea"
    },
    {
      "key": "018a0eb",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Очень сильный",
      "sourceEnText": "Very strong",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_018a0eb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1123,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:00Z",
      "textHash": "36acf9986f1c11dcc67efafe0560e178f8e24029ef3dde32b497474d30767f3a"
    },
    {
      "key": "01f30c4",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Машины едут быстро. Как мне безопасно перейти дорогу?",
      "sourceEnText": "The cars are driving fast. How can I cross safely?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_01f30c4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3971,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:50Z",
      "textHash": "28bad7f2c95fdced5cd00de18d03f01de22c9b9f30ad4396b607dc6d5595203a"
    },
    {
      "key": "0210ef0",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Я в Париже. Я турист. Собака по кличке Антура забрала мою книгу о Париже!",
      "sourceEnText": "I'm visiting Paris. I'm a tourist. Antura the dog took my book about Paris!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0210ef0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6896,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:42Z",
      "textHash": "8572a128bf5546256de958f60a399d3f3f4eab3051abe9aed815be20aefcf1a3"
    },
    {
      "key": "021f382",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Почему этот мост знаменит?",
      "sourceEnText": "What is special about this famous bridge?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_021f382.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:42Z",
      "textHash": "f166a5eed198ec048234b9ca04909ceffed3a62c96b2987a8aedc5ff9ce0ac74"
    },
    {
      "key": "02349a3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Для перевозки автомобилей",
      "sourceEnText": "To transport cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02349a3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:37Z",
      "textHash": "39b4bdb5f3d6eadb13383fb9da8ee6a49dd0e2790a4abed1c3c4dc3094cf1eaa"
    },
    {
      "key": "0280e8f",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Сегодня вы откроете для себя Сену и её многочисленные мосты. На Сене ходят самые разные суда.",
      "sourceEnText": "Today, you will discover the Seine and its many bridges. On the Seine, there are all kinds of boats.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0280e8f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6557,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:15Z",
      "textHash": "e5cd8fe8d5deaf96cbdb5c97fb02a112fa14d6af257eebce81c9f4c537238122"
    },
    {
      "key": "0281b33",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Сена впадает в Ла-Манш (море) в северном направлении.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine flows into the English Channel (a sea) in a northerly direction.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0281b33.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:18Z",
      "textHash": "05193283a569379f9d4409742908265a08b7c4da2233e0104e0572eb99e86135"
    },
    {
      "key": "02ab1e0",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Средиземное море",
      "sourceEnText": "The Mediterranean Sea",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02ab1e0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:53Z",
      "textHash": "fc77fae77d2dabb2d4f8d55fe06508fc332414ec72241ee2f58afd1504fe2397"
    },
    {
      "key": "02ce3de",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Почему на туристическом катере такие большие окна?",
      "sourceEnText": "Why does a tourist boat have big windows?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02ce3de.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3370,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:34Z",
      "textHash": "24bbeb0ed2838aa1f7c8837da7c068d3adabf2c0e85d3c77c66264e206a2ddb0"
    },
    {
      "key": "02ed36d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat",
      "sourceText": "Да, я видела, как гуляла собака.",
      "sourceEnText": "I did see a dog walking around, yes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_02ed36d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:23Z",
      "textHash": "1c43eb3c4f1f9e14b329f606d0fac97bfd143643ad75c786ad853deed5bc0a15"
    },
    {
      "key": "036ba15",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Эта лодка перевозит груз.",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat is transporting goods",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_036ba15.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:31Z",
      "textHash": "67347774f42827b552ad5f306cd5890babad9e5c5eabd30ec24d3478f42e5716"
    },
    {
      "key": "037efcf",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Погрузиться под воду",
      "sourceEnText": "To go under the water",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_037efcf.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1515,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:39Z",
      "textHash": "4e233245da50593a1ec2eb48e29407b3fa820092915598907cd01afd6fe40be0"
    },
    {
      "key": "038b8f6",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_woman",
      "sourceText": "В Париже много мостов!",
      "sourceEnText": "There are many bridges in Paris!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_038b8f6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:34Z",
      "textHash": "56a1e756aa8635d4af3e88f42fe3444e8e39ee4ae4c6d9bb00444ebe26ce15e1"
    },
    {
      "key": "0395113",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "Сена очень длинная!",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine is very long!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0395113.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:40Z",
      "textHash": "8c39ea626b5987d6724d85d3dc8aa3e71d6638d8e03d5e9f493c632a6cf3499a"
    },
    {
      "key": "03c92db",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Ла-Манш",
      "sourceEnText": "The English Channel",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03c92db.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 810,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:58Z",
      "textHash": "100c37647fe84c2c2c972fc7af7cd7aa9ad92b189a21aa021e8fdfa3e5eab073"
    },
    {
      "key": "03e5667",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_ile_de_france",
      "sourceText": "Есть остров под названием Иль-де-ла-Сите.",
      "sourceEnText": "There is an island called Île de la Cité.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03e5667.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:27Z",
      "textHash": "5a25e295bf952c9c3cb306f06f833a3787d116433b143571a29ac84053765ed5"
    },
    {
      "key": "03ea48b",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "У вас всё хорошо получается!",
      "sourceEnText": "You are doing well!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03ea48b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2978,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:39Z",
      "textHash": "cbd737eaf961344d045b186dd18bccfa3d8f4ce71eeba6ded25b656445294752"
    },
    {
      "key": "03ff912",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Только для прогулок",
      "sourceEnText": "Only for walking",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_03ff912.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1358,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:04Z",
      "textHash": "02b319b276d4ee3903e19cdd3c40762239111e0540005e3a5969c31f78d397c3"
    },
    {
      "key": "04059bd",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Что можно найти на грузовом судне?",
      "sourceEnText": "What can you find on a goods boat?",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_04059bd.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:05Z",
      "textHash": "6a1d9ae685092f43e8be67eb1179c61a5007320218a0e5c71fb07fd40e2720b4"
    },
    {
      "key": "042160f",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Добро пожаловать в Париж! Париж — столица Франции. В Париже протекает очень известная река. Эта река называется Сена.",
      "sourceEnText": "Welcome to Paris! Paris is the capital of France. In Paris, there is a very famous river. This river is called the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_042160f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 8882,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:12Z",
      "textHash": "9aa84d7ffbcaa6577de84c97d275afd4cb58b580432c6920ff8044a2866832cf"
    },
    {
      "key": "0454688",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_people",
      "sourceText": "Чтобы увидеть город и известные места",
      "sourceEnText": "To see the city and famous places",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0454688.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:36Z",
      "textHash": "72b675c57aba46da8e30e73c4c239f04501aa7fcc1f0468eab964f9de14f5c1b"
    },
    {
      "key": "047502b",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_boat_guide",
      "sourceText": "Туристические суда имеют большие окна.",
      "sourceEnText": "Tourist boats have large windows.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_047502b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2900,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:52Z",
      "textHash": "7848fb708a00c9cdfcc2cf8a57e7369517a022be33c8d4f8f7e35ab1361bfe1d"
    },
    {
      "key": "0484ee9",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_people",
      "sourceText": "Мост, предназначенный исключительно для пешеходов, называется...",
      "sourceEnText": "A bridge only for people to walk on is called a...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0484ee9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 4023,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:10Z",
      "textHash": "7fe00c07636bb83066cee882d8a9c24e360b37549fa6da864a4d612854758bad"
    },
    {
      "key": "0494564",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "Мне очень нравится кататься на велосипеде вдоль Сены!",
      "sourceEnText": "I really enjoy cycling along the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0494564.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:37Z",
      "textHash": "2c4bf4e71a1fcc67751e161dcc92256ffc44fe7c725f8aa9ea30f90175781d11"
    },
    {
      "key": "04b2cf2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_ile_de_france",
      "sourceText": "Он расположен в старом центре Парижа.",
      "sourceEnText": "It is in the old center of Paris.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_04b2cf2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:28Z",
      "textHash": "a1b37cb6f13e0bb96f9275bcfbf709cf17d9b93a47c6c8ef967552fdf39f03f3"
    },
    {
      "key": "052fdac",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Атлантический океан",
      "sourceEnText": "The Atlantic Ocean",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_052fdac.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1698,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:01Z",
      "textHash": "c4a67ac3a3c5e5ddacf58d66448eb64db966769e8b1b91b643c8502d100c8fc2"
    },
    {
      "key": "055d822",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Это мост для поездов.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for trains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_055d822.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1593,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:29Z",
      "textHash": "b20cfd29db80a95b4586f8eaf068ab41363f0919ded3907e78e0240e29f3d2c2"
    },
    {
      "key": "056c933",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Там есть статуи, сделанные из золота.",
      "sourceEnText": "There are statues made of gold.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_056c933.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2769,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:44Z",
      "textHash": "8d8726e8c0d1c1ecaeaf035fe339de7a3a18748e83ef539d9b0ca15099e4ecb5"
    },
    {
      "key": "0574872",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_train",
      "sourceText": "Я обожаю поезда!",
      "sourceEnText": "I love trains!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0574872.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1306,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:07Z",
      "textHash": "4ce742332e2f3c922429d711c909116561c721d78cc3d4b5e411d969722ce813"
    },
    {
      "key": "059f66d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_eiffel",
      "sourceText": "Посмотрите, как это красиво!",
      "sourceEnText": "Look how pretty it is!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_059f66d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1881,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:25Z",
      "textHash": "39a9e866c964711c7ada9e349011c23540ad23cc07eb5409261539b4e3cdb89d"
    },
    {
      "key": "05c2518",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Это мост для поездов.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for trains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_05c2518.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:45Z",
      "textHash": "b20cfd29db80a95b4586f8eaf068ab41363f0919ded3907e78e0240e29f3d2c2"
    },
    {
      "key": "0614aef",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat",
      "sourceText": "Нет, я не видела вашу собаку.",
      "sourceEnText": "No, I haven't seen your dog.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0614aef.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2064,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:20Z",
      "textHash": "8677c7e45d26c790574211d170d93b5c76d8ec7e4a554f6d973ba4b58b611874"
    },
    {
      "key": "062cc35",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Для туристов есть лодки. В них большие окна, из которых открывается вид на памятники Парижа с Сены.",
      "sourceEnText": "There are boats for tourists. They have large windows to see the monuments of Paris from the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_062cc35.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6243,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:21Z",
      "textHash": "69fed51d9d48cc7cacb7f865ba38bcdcbeb6ebae57ec4e9f677ae5ce62783f08"
    },
    {
      "key": "06638a3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Вагоны поезда",
      "sourceEnText": "Train cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_06638a3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1123,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:13Z",
      "textHash": "62187c1692ecc09237321804e5c2baaf50ceb194d231de8727dd0378996078bd"
    },
    {
      "key": "066d7bd",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Река, протекающая через Париж, называется...",
      "sourceEnText": "The river that flows through Paris is called...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_066d7bd.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:52Z",
      "textHash": "0a4f34c599d4e1fdf3b8f4924b4acd09bb20b1119d1dc5a1568562c7db81bfee"
    },
    {
      "key": "06aa0c1",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "Привет!",
      "sourceEnText": "Hi!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_06aa0c1.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 810,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:36Z",
      "textHash": "604625a2bf19b8bd6f16c82c5c15a3fc3c382c4aa4802b9640e996e15641ed97"
    },
    {
      "key": "06d2470",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_river_friend",
      "sourceText": "На картах показаны извилины реки.",
      "sourceEnText": "The maps show the meanders of the river.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_06d2470.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2534,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:49Z",
      "textHash": "82ce55f3a826b57f2d9423d0d6fe249777eba048f97fa253d11a20e70441478a"
    },
    {
      "key": "072a345",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_woman",
      "sourceText": "Доброе утро!",
      "sourceEnText": "Good morning!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_072a345.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1123,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:31Z",
      "textHash": "3960e17f61fa8c30541c85841a701ac69e09ac154f8c8beb2c190aac1e39abd9"
    },
    {
      "key": "074efa5",
      "nodeTitle": "facts_river",
      "sourceText": "Сена впадает в Ла-Манш.",
      "sourceEnText": "The Seine flows into the English Channel.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_074efa5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1698,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:30Z",
      "textHash": "34bf2a34fdd2a38f65e149a0aef0bc447d0b27eb9d4916b0c5723a97f00ee641"
    },
    {
      "key": "076ee7f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Переходить дорогу можно где угодно.",
      "sourceEnText": "You can cross the road anywhere.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_076ee7f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2299,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:54Z",
      "textHash": "85a9cfe489e53b722a786e646643b5b39e501c72d7638d16a9aa1bf33a327cf8"
    },
    {
      "key": "07cac48",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Вы нашли все фотографии из моего путеводителя!",
      "sourceEnText": "You found all the photos from my guide!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_07cac48.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3082,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:30Z",
      "textHash": "32c0978719f5aa6be233a3a527f75f83aafd28b14a5ba80d80688acfaf6d383a"
    },
    {
      "key": "07f732f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_people",
      "sourceText": "мост для автомобилей",
      "sourceEnText": "a bridge for cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_07f732f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1463,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:15Z",
      "textHash": "36cee94c597e3745769373ac60865042fd863374ef7cc62eff40c5525cb550cd"
    },
    {
      "key": "0816b6b",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "Железнодорожный мост должен быть прочным.",
      "sourceEnText": "A train bridge must be strong.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0816b6b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:42Z",
      "textHash": "4ffde69594a9aae107d82045978beb31f2e5fee1c96dd10050a7d1881e6c9467"
    },
    {
      "key": "084c7e4",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Прогуляйтесь вдоль берегов Сены и найдите фотографии!",
      "sourceEnText": "Take a walk along the banks of the Seine and find the photos!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_084c7e4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3396,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:35Z",
      "textHash": "660298d67527d00113da0301857318bb8d9b62f42750396a947d307ccf8243d1"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b0aea",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Наконец-то я могу идти домой! У меня остался последний вопрос…",
      "sourceEnText": "I can finally go home! I have one last question…",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b0aea.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4336,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:31Z",
      "textHash": "51d9ef0e6753dc5b52f8ae7a0ba538b3aba16493ba4f3d199e277ede6ad5bfa4"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b1177",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Посмотрите на эту карту Сены.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look at this map of the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b1177.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2064,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:16Z",
      "textHash": "e4abadf2c6f5b7f3719453d3129f01c54033b0908ac8bcd6442a011cc7bbdf6c"
    },
    {
      "key": "08b4fad",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "для автомобилей",
      "sourceEnText": "for cars",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08b4fad.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1176,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:02Z",
      "textHash": "7456d9ed8efdf49ae57ab2486dbcc17217a518a48ec067ffdd91dd463e886a92"
    },
    {
      "key": "08cc02a",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Важные памятники Парижа были возведены вдоль Сены.",
      "sourceEnText": "Important monuments in Paris were built around the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08cc02a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3370,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:25Z",
      "textHash": "07ccd18074dcfe52251a5383b3fe9d9a701357f60dca238e7cb5fbe08475ff9c"
    },
    {
      "key": "08d8ef0",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "Автомобили ежедневно пересекают реку.",
      "sourceEnText": "Cars cross the river every day.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_08d8ef0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2795,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:46Z",
      "textHash": "3b4aaf8d29304c948b86015565ec107640e30039a2e56b2b876c961e63bd293b"
    },
    {
      "key": "091e9fc",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Вы открыли для себя мосты и лодки Сены. Мосты позволяют вам пересечь реку, протекающую через Париж: Сену.",
      "sourceEnText": "You discovered the bridges and boats of the Seine. The bridges allow you to cross the river that flows through Paris: the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_091e9fc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 8568,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:19Z",
      "textHash": "5bf3efc28aa9629d3971a825519eba9be305e8dbe1962bdedbd42e5a3996bb56"
    },
    {
      "key": "09731f9",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Железнодорожный мост — это мост...",
      "sourceEnText": "A train bridge is a bridge...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09731f9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2717,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:59Z",
      "textHash": "be2a63ef4e4e54a732b46299f6ef6faf8d26a170ebc1da38615b3c6e5df2160f"
    },
    {
      "key": "099fe86",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Это неверный ответ. Луара протекает через Нант, недалеко от музея Жюля Верна.",
      "sourceEnText": "That's not the correct answer. The Loire flows through Nantes, near the Jules Verne Museum.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_099fe86.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5695,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:56Z",
      "textHash": "7482a1c453a0520793b9fb947a0db65b1ab9902bee6d02472623ce3c6e567d5a"
    },
    {
      "key": "09c706f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_alexandre",
      "sourceText": "Это мост Александра III. Очень известный мост.",
      "sourceEnText": "This is the Alexander III Bridge. It's a very famous bridge.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09c706f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3187,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:41Z",
      "textHash": "e7ed8dfca6e53108bdadedb5ceefb314d10276e174f6ea4536fbdd57511c735c"
    },
    {
      "key": "09f3f7a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat",
      "sourceText": "Собака? Здесь много собак...",
      "sourceEnText": "A dog? There are many dogs here...",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_09f3f7a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:21Z",
      "textHash": "58a9f6958b25e1a638154484d6cc9b836a2456405b544152900adac226fa1c6c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a0991d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_train",
      "sourceText": "Это мост для поездов!",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for trains!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a0991d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1698,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:57Z",
      "textHash": "1c370896e2295a3cb4689e29188b65c89c9f702f82788b059223611146686753"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a29742",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Существуют плавучие дома. Люди живут на этих лодках. Их называют баржами.",
      "sourceEnText": "There are houseboats. People live on these boats. They are called barges.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a29742.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5068,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:23Z",
      "textHash": "85cb1954910a8546df6a49a0734c5fb49c565e7ef51a98ac9f5a3af4e8a1b6f7"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a2bcd3",
      "nodeTitle": "question_seine_map",
      "sourceText": "Да, это Сена. Река, протекающая через Париж, называется Сена.",
      "sourceEnText": "Yes, it's the Seine. The river that flows through Paris is called the Seine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a2bcd3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6243,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:59Z",
      "textHash": "cb93234bc58205bda651e59ec9a2bdec60a69d9b60afdd94ca43a497c180b589"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a627c2",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Эта лодка — дом. На этой лодке живут люди. Такая лодка называется плавучим домом.",
      "sourceEnText": "This boat is a house. There are people who live on this boat. This boat is called a houseboat.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a627c2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6531,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:25Z",
      "textHash": "e135376f64bd3e12feb2f5ea269bd5375d46eb54de036a635b7afbcdb0203f8d"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a70250",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Спасибо!",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a70250.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 993,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:28Z",
      "textHash": "d6694f929aed9f90e8d81b8ea63cb2cfd2f567127b69eec74d5008b49774ff65"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a9c8e7",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Прогуляйтесь вдоль реки, и вы найдете эти фотографии!",
      "sourceEnText": "Walk near the river and you'll find the photos!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0a9c8e7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5355,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:46Z",
      "textHash": "a8c902de88614b5af931696b04c618d385f39662b495e8ce0ebf4220ac1aa21f"
    },
    {
      "key": "0aa0f3a",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Помогите! Помогите мне!",
      "sourceEnText": "Help! Help me!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0aa0f3a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2142,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:40Z",
      "textHash": "e076cefedbc22f0561ecda403fd580758a3a387353b0dcb428106bf53c3180a2"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b12cb3",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Грузовое судно может перевозить: древесину, песок, а также предметы: автомобили, мебель...",
      "sourceEnText": "Boxes and things",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0b12cb3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5721,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:07Z",
      "textHash": "0a4bc13bd6cdc9a576cb31358a04ffc591a7a616bb7b316d811a319ff413c603"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b37e92",
      "nodeTitle": "post_quest_activity",
      "sourceText": "Нарисуйте мост в своей тетради!",
      "sourceEnText": "Draw a bridge in your notebook!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0b37e92.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2299,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:26Z",
      "textHash": "1fc25f2a2b46fb0a42a85effb6ad8696e9d408e07558b61dabb9d8609b1f88ba"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ba2f29",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_bridge_expert",
      "sourceText": "Некоторые мосты предназначены исключительно для пешеходов.",
      "sourceEnText": "Some bridges are intended for pedestrians only.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0ba2f29.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3683,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:44Z",
      "textHash": "ed7323e9578158b5c4fda3468e40e05b46785d9fcd990433c2cf37da8c029596"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bbd3ce",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_goods",
      "sourceText": "Туристы с фотоаппаратами",
      "sourceEnText": "Tourists with cameras",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0bbd3ce.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:10Z",
      "textHash": "fa039c469909531a9085beced740ceea47d3ff85af99097fe4d55f1380603d3c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bfcb05",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Если вы не можете их найти, вы можете воспользоваться картой Парижа, чтобы определить их местоположение!",
      "sourceEnText": "If you can't find them, you can use the map of Paris to locate them!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0bfcb05.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 6844,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:37Z",
      "textHash": "60897469a66cd8c117c723f34e323f716f9543479799f56cd3a0a0d677856883"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c408c3",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_end",
      "sourceText": "Отлично, вы выполнили это задание!",
      "sourceEnText": "Great, you've completed this quest!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c408c3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4650,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:17Z",
      "textHash": "e27bfb122ca853da094fba761499518f0899aa039815711444f5c7bb40f71b0c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c86d26",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_boat_house",
      "sourceText": "Там можно жить.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's possible to live there.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c86d26.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1228,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:28Z",
      "textHash": "4792c5b0e687899f508ba59ab6bd34e0950cc933f25f0cc1f2771343ee4dd119"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c8cdae",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Необходимо идти по тротуару и перейти дорогу по пешеходному переходу.",
      "sourceEnText": "Use the sidewalk and cross at the crossing",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c8cdae.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4650,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:52Z",
      "textHash": "d9976a43f27f8cc5b6b49629ebfbfa3712478c804373e07b4d473f284255b12e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c8e7b6",
      "nodeTitle": "protagonist",
      "sourceText": "Страницы моей книги и фотографии упали недалеко от Сены!",
      "sourceEnText": "The pages of my book and the photos fell near the Seine!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0c8e7b6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3736,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:06:44Z",
      "textHash": "238406e48cf02dd78852d20d47e16fa97bd0fc1587fe8d4b0d16555d04445c88"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cf371b",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Вам придётся идти по дороге.",
      "sourceEnText": "You have to walk on the road",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0cf371b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:55Z",
      "textHash": "8072ace588dfdbe7626416059e33f784a6b9e20830cab98d0ce85e9e7e028dd3"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d1724c",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_river_friend",
      "sourceText": "Река впадает в море.",
      "sourceEnText": "The river flows into the sea.",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d1724c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1593,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:50Z",
      "textHash": "35d5640056dbe31e6e19921cbef2acd2feee6373163e59e9ca2e7c8ae2b0664d"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d79d7d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_bridge_cars",
      "sourceText": "Это мост для автомобилей!",
      "sourceEnText": "It's a bridge for cars!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d79d7d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1829,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:07:49Z",
      "textHash": "6f44efa7f9bfcace832ba431082d2e0b20b117332d79a97b5e02c4412e53b695"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d94ea8",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_french_man",
      "sourceText": "Париж — самый красивый город в мире!",
      "sourceEnText": "Paris is the most beautiful city in the world!",
      "audioFile": "fr_10_0d94ea8.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2664,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T23:08:39Z",
